<title>FRANCE: French shares come back from lows.</title>
<headline>French shares come back from lows.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>French shares came back from their lows after falling by more than one percent. Brokers said Tuesday night's speech by President Jacques Chirac did not have much market impact.</p>
<p>* CAC-40 index down 27.23, or 1.02 percent, at 2,653.11 at 0848 GMT</p>
<p>* CAC-40 May futures 2,652 vs 2,679 at Tuesday's close.</p>
<p>* Of CAC-40 stocks, four higher, 36 lower, none unchanged.</p>
<p>* Broader SBF120 index down 15.47 at 1,829.06</p>
</text>
